kaij shopkeep meek~
Kaij the Meek~
Kaij sits here with legs crossed, awaiting your request.
~
   No one is sure how long Kaij has been with the Guild, but he has always been
here since you and everyone you know joined the temple.  Known to friends as
'the Meek', Kaij is always very calm, and speaks in a quiet, even voice.  He
wears about him a simple linen robe with a sash, and no sandals.  A thin layer
of dark hair covers his shaved head.    
~
