guild grand flower hruang elder man~
Hruang, the Grandmaster of Flowers~
An elderly man sits here in quiet contemplation.
~
   The grandmaster of flowers is a kind and gentle man, unless you have the
unfortunate chance to meet him in battle.  He looks like a man who is in
constant contemplation, even in battle it looks as if he was working out every
possible move before he executed it.  He would be a good role model to follow.
Hruang is the only shou-lin that has been a member of all the orders.  
Currently, he follows the middle path.
~
